codex
The root cause is now concrete: this sandbox’s PID namespace reports a process ID whose `/proc/<pid>/exe` entry is absent, and Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via exactly that path. I’m adding a narrow audit-only `readlink` shim that maps only `/proc/<digits>/exe` to `/proc/self/exe`; it preserves the pinned compiler and libraries while repairing that namespace mismatch.
apply patch
