   133	/- Stable insertion using source `<`. Equal and incomparable pairs follow one
   134	   fixed totalization: retain their input order. -/
   135	private def proofInsertBySourceOrder
   136	    (value : SortVal) : List SortVal → List SortVal
   137	  | [] => [value]
